# 22. RDP

RDP stands for **Remote Desktop Protocol**.

It allows an authorized user to remotely connect to and interact with a Windows computer.

Common RDP port:

```text
TCP 3389
```

### Security

Remote access should always follow organizational authorization and security policies.

